IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-DEEPSEEK-MLA-ROPE.

DATA DIVISION.
01 HIDDEN-DIM          PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 KV-LATENT-DIM       PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 ROPE-DIM            PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 COMPRESSION-RATIO-X100 PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-MLA-ROPE.
    IF KV-LATENT-DIM == 0
        GO TO ERROR-EXIT.
    END-IF.

    COMPUTE COMPRESSION-RATIO-X100 = (HIDDEN-DIM * 2 * 100) / (KV-LATENT-DIM + ROPE-DIM).

    SET depth 4.
    WEIGHT 32 COMPRESSION-RATIO-X100.
    WEIGHT 30 KV-LATENT-DIM.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 15.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

ERROR-EXIT.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
